<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Onobasulu Translation</book>
  <para style="h">Agele Fida</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fidahe Sowi Agele Ewe Seleba Ufulu</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Fida</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Fid</para>
  <para style="rem">First draft by the team in 2014?</para>
  <para style="rem">Advisor Check of Chapter 1 - 3.9 in June 2022 via Zoom with Wabele Fuga, Dickson Wadaga and Beverly Mosley in Ukarumpa, Anne Stoppels in the Netherlands.</para>
  <para style="rem">Advisor Check of 3.10 - 5.14 in October 2022 in Ukarumpa with Wabele Fuga, Yobe Maibi and Dickson Wadaga. Anne Stoppels present in Ukarumpa.</para>
  <para style="rem">Consultant check by correspondence by Paulus Kieviet, August/September 2023</para>
  <para style="mt">1 Fida</para>
  <para style="mt2">Fidahe Sowi Agele Ewe Seleba Ufulu</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Fida ehe sowi selelu ewe, sigidubulu idele inolo Asia Maina helea ami budiba dedaleba yaalu alebaibumofea seleba melu. Sigidubulu idele inolo ami kakainabu ili amo, higinilu difemone, ehe ili kiwigaaba ofelesia, sowi ewe ilifea seleba melu. E-mo, ilifea eweguba selefe. “Sigidubulu idele inolo gilimo, Gode Ene iminilu idele inolo amone koleba labe. Yesu Kelisone awalu sulu nafulu amo, saabia asigimale. Yesu E olafasia haiba degefia, Ehe oloba huliale sulu eweguba solu. E saabia obegeba miyoba solu. Yesu auba solugulu, gilihe E oloba huliale sulu saaba ufulu amone hilisesia, E milesi yasiyo dobu.” Fidahe ilifea auba seleba mefe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aufia, sowi ewe usu Fida eweguba selefe. “Sigidubulu idele inolomo higinilu diaba yaafe. Amone hidigiba bamabiyo. Eweguba hilisema. Higinilu holobagagafe amomo, gine asigi ule ufulu dedeba besabe. Aulugulu, gine asigi ule ufulumo kiwigaafia adabia abia, Keliso obegeba saabi, fogo amimo, gilihe elebe nafulu diyobafe.” Aufia, Fida selesia, “Inolo gafea wolu molofe amofea, wolu sabe obegeba memabiyoba solu. Naga ga dulumo, ga waagimasia, digifia malale.”</para>
  <para style="ip">Aufia, kegele no, Fida sowi usu ewe seleba ufulu amo, ewe. “Sigidubulu idele inolo, gili koleba, Yesu Keliso Ene idele inolo alebaibu. Aulugulu, gili Ene mana kuliba abia daabasu ligia, Godedai muuba kalilu melale.” Aufia, Fidahe idoda dulu ilifeada, guni inolo ilifeada, faibe fisamili ilifeada, auba molomaleba sulu seleba ufulu.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Na <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char>. Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> ulenomo, na lolu. Nahe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Sowi ewe seleba mesia, Gode molobebelelu idele inolo gili hele fogoba asulu Fodusu amida, Galasia amida, Kabodosia amida, Asia amida, Bidinia amida, budiba dolaneba sibaisalo gilifea seleba mesu.<verse eid="1PE 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 8:29">Lom 8.29</ref>; <ref loc="2TH 2:13">2Des 2.13</ref></char>
    </note>Amakele koleba, Nao Godehe gili asigifia, gili Ene idele inolo melesi molobebelelu. <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> alefasia, gili Godedai <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> melesi moloba ofolaba labe. Gili Yesu Kelisone sulu dobelesia, nafuluba kuliba malesi aulu. Aufia, Yesu Kelisone ibihe gilifea gasaliba dowelune, gili Godene olegia galagololu miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 1:2" />
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Godehe <char style="w">kanululo</char> manada, <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba ofolo</char> manada, gine libo usu bulemesi moloba ufiyobafe. Ehe auba molomesi, na Edai sulu selaba lolu.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miliyolu miliyo nafuluhe nini hebene yasifia labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Ninihe Godene wi digiyoba. E nine <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesu Kelisone Enao ligia, Gode labe. Ehe nini bule yagunagafia, Yesu Keliso olalu degeba ifolu eno amo alefasia, ninimo hili galinofasia, miliyolu hagaea melu. Ausimo, Ehe kegele nafulu noolo ninifea memesine, nini <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasiba</char> lolu. Nini hame balu diba ofogofale. Aubale. <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:12">Kol 1.12</ref></char></note><char style="w">Hebene</char> lagi daalo seale gineba madeneba diba dobu. Daalo amo nugumadale ligia, belasia seseneyobafale. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 10:28">Yon 10.28</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:11">17.11</ref></char></note>Gili Kelisofea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule dobu</char> amofea alefasia, Godene kiwigagaluhe gili luba ligia, haguguba ofelefe. Ehe gili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoiya</char> fogo ami helegeba mesesine, kegele sunia madeneba ufulu dobu. Amomo, aleba eloyo fogo adesi, ami ulufaeyobafe.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 5:10">1Fid 5.10</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:2">Yem 1.2</ref></char>
    </note>Aga fogo wedino yaagi, dedeba babiyo nokene nokeneba holobagagasia, gilifea naga meba yaafe. Amo sealeso, hama. Gilihe kegele Gode moloyobafe amone hilisesia, nokene koleba henemale. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 17:3">Snd 17.3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 13:9">Sek 13.9</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:3">Mal 3.3</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:3">Yem 1.3</ref></char></note>Dedeba bolo mana amofea alefasia, Godehe nine asigi ule ufulu kolelulaba eloba bolo. Asigima. Gili asigi ule ufulu amomo, <char style="w" lemma="Golo">gologulu</char>, yogolelu ligia, eleda bule koleba dobu. Asigi ule ufulu amone ele amohe, golone ele wasolu koleba dobu. Enebamo, golomo helefealune kegele ligia, asigilelo kegele dobu. Golomo, ilihe golo sealelaba, me golo sealealelaba, eloba babiyonemo de soba bolo. Amogubasu, kegele dedeba babiyo nonoba gilifea holobagasimo, amo gine asigi ule Kelisofea ufulu ogo, seale dobulaba eloba babiyone dedeba besabe. Nine asigi ule ufulu amo auba seale kolefia, nafulu labeba eloba baafia labi, Yesu Keliso ulufaba holobagafea fogo ami, Godehe gilifea heafuba henefia, wi bule <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elaleluda</char> mesia, gili wabialeyobafe.<verse eid="1PE 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 20:29">Yon 20.29</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 5:7">2Kld 5.7</ref></char>
    </note>Gilihe Yesu bolaleso, E hamesefia labe. Aufia, aga gili E baabale ligiaso, Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesia</char>, Efea heafuba nokene henelo. Henelo amo, helefealune henelo wasolugulu, amone nini saeyoda babealu koleba. <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />Gili auba henefe maumo, asigi ule ofelesia migagaba aafea ami goasiamo, gili gasiba dafelagoba obegeba duluiya ami goafebu. <verse eid="1PE 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">Mad 13.16-17</ref></char></note>Saminimo, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo ilihe, gasiba dafelagoba obegeba dulu fogo amo, wagilaba isalabia daabasu alolu. Ilihe sulu saaba ofelesia, Godehe gilifea kanuluyobafeba saaba ufulu. Ilihe auba saaba ofolaba aloluso, Godehe idele inolo halaguba gasiba dafelagoba obegeba diyobafelaba fadaba babiyosia, ili momoleba hiliselabia daabasu alolu. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22">Sng 22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53">Ais 53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:26-27">Lug 24.26-27</ref></char></note>Kelisone Asubanehe, saaba ofolo ine libo usu ligia, kegele aso holobagabale labi, holobagaeyobafeba selesia, Kelisohe naga nokene nokeneba diyobafeba saaba ufulu. E naga difasia, wi bule <char style="w">elalelu</char> diyobafeba saaba ufulu. Auluso, saaba ofolo ilihe, kegele amo fogo halaiyago halaguba holobagaeyobafelaba kelesia, doba beaba alolu. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Godehe ilifea eweguba walelu. Kegele ili saaba ufulu amo, ine ili sagoba ufiyone soluale. Aubale. Gili koleba sagoba ufiyone, ilihe sulu amo ulufaba saaba ofolaba yaalu. Kegele holobagaeyobafeba sulu saaba ufulu amo, agamo gilifea solu dobu. Enebamo, <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> hebenefia hilibailu amo alefasia, inolo noolo awalu sulu nafulu gilifea waleba yaasi, gili amo dubulu. <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> ilida, kegele nafulu Godehe gilifea halaguba molofelaba, fadaba babaiyeba hameba alebaibu.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe nini noekene muuba kalilu melesi welu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Inolo ogoba maiyone madenesia, ene fagulo selale aboboba madibu fedoba ofologuba, gilida aubasu, gine asigi amo nafuluba uluba ligia, madenefia melale. Aufia, gili asigi sawalu melale. Yesu Keliso ulufaba holobagasi, Godehe gilifea kanuluyobafe. Amone gine <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame koleba diba ofogofia yasifia</char> melale. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:2">Lom 12.2</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:3">Efe 2.3</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:17-18">4.17-18</ref></char></note>Gili kolebamo, faibe selefe dobolo amogulu melale. Saminimo, gili babealu ligia, gilihe mesegelo wolu amone kuliba dedaleba ado. Auluso, agamo, molobaiyelo hame amohe gili saabia no yasimesi fogo memabiyo. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Gode gilida welu amo, E <char style="w">noekene</char> <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> labe. Amogubasu gilida, kegele sunia gili molofea ami, noekene muuba kalilu miliyone moloba dafelagobasu melale. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:44-45">Wkp 11.44-45</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:48">Mad 5.48</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Godene Bugohe eweguba selelu dobu. <char style="qt">“Na noekene muuba kalilu lolugulu, gilida noekene muuba kalilu melale.”</char><verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kelisohe su bule sulufasia, nini elegesia, sububa dafelagoba dulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 2:11">Lom 2.11</ref>; <ref loc="REV 2:23">MUU 2.23</ref></char>
    </note>Godehe inolone wi hilisefia osolalale. Aubale. E isolusu ligia, idele inolo elebi elebiba molofe mana bafasia, osolalo. Aulugulu, helefealu iwi gili haiba mulu idele inolo sibaisafea fogo ami, gilihe Godefea Nao-oooba selesenaga, amo baaba sagilisia, E sisa koleba melale. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />E sisa ligia, eweguba hiliseba melale. Saminimo, gine gauwadalihe ine mana eleda male amo, ine faibilifea melabia miliba labi, gilida mana amosu mololabia daaba alolubiyo. Gili mana eleda male amofeafia sububa dafelagolumo, <char style="w">golo</char>, me silifa, asigilelo kegele amoguluhe, gili obegeba disia elegeluale. <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:5">Kis 12.5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:29">Yon 1.29</ref></char></note>Aubale. Kelisone ibi koleba amohe gili elegelu. <char style="w">Dofene sibi edo</char>, domala nugumadale yogolelusu ligia, soba meyone dasigasia dufa olaloguba, Keliso e auba olalu. Ene ibi saeyoda babealu amohe, gili elegelu. Auba hiliseba melale.<verse eid="1PE 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 1:9-10">2Dim 1.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:4">Efe 1.4</ref></char>
    </note>Helefealuda aso molobale aloiya fogo ami, Godehe Kelisomo gili gasiba dafelagoba dimesi iminiba ufulu. Aufia, aleba eloyo fogo ninida aga labea iwimo, Godehe E-mo gili sagoba ufiyone ulufaba holobagamesi moloba ufulu. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 14:6">Yon 14.6</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 5:1-2">Lom 5.1-2</ref></char></note>Efea alefasia, gili Godefea <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char>. Gode amohe, Keliso olalumo degeba ifosia, Efea wi buleda <char style="w">elalelu</char> melu. Aulugulu, gilihe Godefea asigi ule ofelesia, kegele E moloyobafeba, gine <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasifia</char> labe.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nini koleba nine damenedali hameseyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:34">Yon 13.34</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:10">Lom 12.10</ref></char>
    </note>Seale sulu sodo amone dofasia kuliba daalune, gilihe aga gine libo heesia galagololu moloba ufulu. Auba galagololu ligia, hameselofealo amo, gili saabia no masega hameselugulu meseneyobafale. Aubale, gilihe gine damenedali hamesesiamo, seale hameseyodolu alebaifia labe. Aulugulu, gili gine seba alebale ligia, gine geleba hameselabia daabasu melale. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Enebamo, gili haiba hili no galinofia seba dulu labe. Gili hili galinolumo, sebe belalo amofeafia galinoluale. Aubale. Gili sebe belalale amofeafia galinolu labe. Sebe belalale amo, Godene sulu miliyoluda ligia, ufia miliyobafe amone labe. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.24-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Ais 40.6-8</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Godene Bugo selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 1:24" />
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">
    <char style="qt">“Idele inolo helefealu iwi </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">
    <char style="qt">gisigulu alebaibu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">
    <char style="qt">Ine wi buleda wabialelumo</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">
    <char style="qt">gisine maamogulu alebaibu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">
    <char style="qt">Gisimo odonolo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:24">
    <char style="qt">Maamomo dulubaisalo.</char><verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />
    <char style="qt">Auluso, Saminilone sulumo </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 1:25">
    <char style="qt">ufia ligia alefalu ado.”</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 1:25" />
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Sulu amo, awalu sulu nafulu ilihe gilifea saaba melu amone dobu.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s">Miliyolu miliyone abane nafulu amo, Saminilo E labe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 4:22">Efe 4.22</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:21">Yem 1.21</ref></char>
    </note>Gili hagaea galinofia labene, gili wolu mololo mana suniada, masega gegelo mana suniada, aufia mesenelo manada, aufia lasiaba sodomo sunia hamasia, diba damale. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Gili koleba hili seba dulu labene, faibe subobohe bu hano nabaiyesia hameloguba, gilida aubasu Godene sulu nabaiyeba hamemale. Ili bu hano seale, kegele nodai gegoaluale, hameloguba, gilida asubanene bu hano seale amone nabaiyeba melale. Amo nabiamo, gili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoiya</char> ami ligia suboboyobafe. <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Sng 34.8</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> mana ninifea mololomo naba baafia, gilihe E nafulu nenalebalu besabebuba asigibu.<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Aulugulu, gili Saminilo labea milibaimale. E molo diyone abane miliyoluda labe. Idele inolo ilihe E waaselaba baafia, diba dafulu. Auluso, Godehe E abane saeyoda babealu labi baafia, E molobebelelu. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:21-22">Efe 2.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:6">MUU 1.6</ref></char></note>Gilida abane miliyoluda amogulu labe. Aulune, Asubanefealo molo dimesine, gili koleba, gine gili waagi Moloda Dilofea memale. Ausi, Godehe gili Ene <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melo mosomu</char> moloba ufiyobafe. Gili auba Ene <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> soba melo idele inolo ligia, Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char> alefasia, Gode henemesi, asubanefealomo Efea ulu melabia daaba melale. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Ais 28.16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:20">Efe 2.20</ref></char></note>Godene bugohe amone iminisia eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 2:6" />
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">
    <char style="qt">“Gili bama!</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">
    <char style="qt">Nahe Saiono galea ami abane ule diba ofelesu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">
    <char style="qt">Abane amomo, saeyoda babealu yogolelu ligia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">
    <char style="qt">duguiya melesi molobebelefia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">
    <char style="qt">molo semesi ikau olaibo gadefalu dobu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:6">
    <char style="qt">Idele inolo Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelefemo</char>, yuasia mi nagaeyobafale.”</char><verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sng 118.22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:10">Mag 12.10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 4:11">HD 4.11</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:20">Efe 2.20</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 9:33">Lom 9.33</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:11">1Kld 3.11</ref></char>
    </note>Aulugulu, gili idele inolo asigi uleda ufulumo, gine si saabia Keliso E abane nafulu saeyoda babealu yogolelu labe. Auluso, idele inolo asigi uleda ufuluale amone iminisia, Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 2:7" />
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">“<char style="qt">Abanemo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">
    <char style="qt">moloda dilo ilihe wolubusia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">
    <char style="qt">waaselaba abulu amo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">
    <char style="qt">Aga abane amomo, </char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">
    <char style="qt">moloda kiwigaaba sefia melesine,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:7">
    <char style="qt">duguiya ikau olaibo gadefalu labe.”</char><verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 8:14">Ais 8.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Godene bugo eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 2:8" />
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">
    <char style="qt">“Abane amomo, idele inolo amofea ifili sauwasia gelebaisamesine,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:8">
    <char style="qt">eno ilida dedaleba ada ami ufulu dobu.”</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 2:8" />
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Idele inolo abane amofea ifili sauwasia gelebaifemo, ilihe Godene sulu saidafia labi, aufe. Samini Godehe ili auba moloyobafeba saaba ufulu.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 7:6">Lo 7.6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:2">14.2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:2">Ais 9.2</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Dai 2.14</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:18">HD 26.18</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:8">Efe 5.8</ref></char>
    </note>Auluso, gilimo, <char style="qt">Godehe Ene mosomu idele inolo melesi molobebelesia gadefalu. E gine Kini labi, gilimo E sisa ligia, soba melo mosomu labe. Gili Godene muuba kalilu mosomu idele inolo koleba labe. Gilimo, Gode Ene Enaoba ofelesia iminiba ufulu idele inolo labe. </char> Godehe gili nigili gagaiya amifia milafasia, gili Ene yane yogolelu neeba dowefea ami waagi suga milalu. Auba molosiamo, gilihe mana nafulu E mololomo saaba dafelagomesine auba aulu. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2.23</ref></char></note>Saminimo, gili mosomudale alolu. Auluso, agamo gili Godene mosomu koleba labe. Saminimo, gili <char style="w">kanululo</char> dilale alolu. Auluso, agamo, gili kanululo dulu idele inolo labe.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nini Godene dabalu mololo faibiligulu miliyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 5:17">Gal 5.17</ref>, <ref loc="GAL 5:24">24</ref></char>
    </note>Ne yagusodali koleba, gili helefealu iwi sibaisasia haiba mulu idele inolo alebaibu. Aulugulu, na gilifea eweguba kiwigaaba selesu. Gili koleba wolu molobaiyesia mesegelo amofea hago melale. Mesegelo mana amohe gine asubanedai belaguba yaafe. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:16">Mad 5.16</ref></char></note>Gili <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> aleba ugi kakainafia ligia, mana nafulu kuliba daabasu melale. Ausi, ilihe heleba selesia, gilifea wolu mololusia oloba kowesiaso, gili mana nafulu molofebuba eloba babiyobafe. Ausenaga, osolaeyo hilia adesi, ilihe Godene wi digiyobafe.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="TIT 3:1">Dai 3.1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gili koleba Saminilone hame hilisefia, gamane helefealu iwi yasifia labe amone sisa adesia, gili ine sulu dobolaba melale. Kini e olaibo labegulu, gili koleba, ene sulu kuliba malale. <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />Aufia, gili koleba, gafena ine suluda kuliba malale. Enebamo, kinihe gafena inolomo molobebelefia gadefasi, ilihe idele inolo woluda molofe amone naga sabe meyone madeneba labe. Auluso, idele inolo mana nafuluda molofe amone wimo, ili digiyobafe.<verse eid="1PE 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 3:16">1Fid 3.16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godehe gili mana nafulusu molomesi hamefe. Auba mana nafulu molofe amo alefasia, gilihe inolo asigida male kagoalu suluda selefe ili amone mofeyo kaasia saumafe. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Gili koleba sububa dafogolu ligia, beega idele inolo mana molologuba molomale. Auluso, gilihe beega lolusia, mana wolu nokene nokeneba molomabiyo. Aubale. Gili Godene <char style="w" lemma="Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibe">balu dabalu mololo faibili</char> ligia, E molomafeguba mololabia daabasu melale. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:10">Lom 12.10</ref></char></note>Gili koleba idele inolo sunia baaba momolemale. Aufia, gine sigidubulu damenedali hameseba melale. Aufia, Gode baaba sagilifia, E sisasu melale. Aufia, gilihe kini helefealu iwi yasifia labemo, baabada momolemale.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gada yasibu amofea alefasia ga naga balu disenaga, amo ga waagimasia, e sisa melale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 6:5">Efe 6.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gili aleba ugi, balu dabaluda mololo faibili alebaibumo, gili gine biso baaba sagilisia, ili sisa ligia, ine sulu dofasia nafuluba kuliba malale. Na auba selesiamo, biso nafulu onaluda amonesu selesuale. Aubale. Biso koagelu wolu mololo ili amone sisada melale. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Ee, noolohe isoluale mana kuliba abia, gafea naga balu mesimo, ga Godene hame kuliba daaba ligia, naga amo disia, waagimasenaga, amo <char style="w">kanululo</char> mana walefe.<verse eid="1PE 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 3:14">1Fid 3.14</ref>, <ref loc="1PE 3:17">17</ref></char>
    </note>Enebamo, gili mana wolu molosi, ilihe amone sabesia, gili dufelesia, naga mesi, amone gilihe waagimasenaga, gili auba waagimalu amofeafia kaiiba saeyone mau male adefe. Enebamo, ene molologuba molofe. Auluso, gili mana nafulu molosi, ilihe amone sabesia, gilifea balu naga mesi, amone gilihe waagimasenaga, amo koleba Godene kanululo mana walefe. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:24">Mad 16.24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:15">Yon 13.15</ref></char></note>Gili mana amogulu kuliba malesi, Godehe gili welu. Maumo, Kelisohe gineba naga dulu. Auba ausiamo, Ehe dedeba walesia, gili Ene emo emelalu kuliba milesi walelu.<verse eid="1PE 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:9">Ais 53.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">E alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> ulenoda mololuale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 2:22">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, E masega sulu ulenoda soluale.</char><verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:7">Ais 53.7</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:9">1Fid 3.9</ref></char>
    </note>Idele inolo ilihe Efea lasiaba selesi, Ehe ilifea obegesia sabe lasiaba soluale. Ilihe Efea naga mesi, ilifeada naga memaba soluale. Aubale. Amone sabeyomo, Ehe Isoba Osolalo Gode Ene sone saabia ufulu.<verse eid="1PE 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 6:11">Lom 6.11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53:5-6">Ais 53.5-6</ref></char>
    </note>Nine wolumo, Keliso Ene domalafea disia, imolane goloba helelu. E auba mololumo, nini woluda moloba ada ami nini olamesi aulu. Ausi, nini isolu manada molofea ami, nini bebea miliyobafe. Ene domala momonilu amohe gili waiba waalelu. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:5-6">Ese 34.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:36">Mad 9.36</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:14">Yon 10.14</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 13:20-21">Hib 13.20-21</ref></char></note>Gili <char style="w">dofene sibi</char> heleba babeaba dedaleba alolu amogulu alolubiyo. Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Dofene sibi uluba ado">Dofene Sibida Uluba Adohe</char> gine asubane nafuluba luba melesi, gili agamo E labea obegeba milibailu labe. <figure style="fig" alt="Shepherd and sheep in pasture" file="09_1Sa_16_15_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="2.25">Gili dofene sibigulu labene, gilida uluba labemo, Yesu E.</figure><verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s">Dulu idele inolofea sulu selefe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe 5.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Balu dabalu moloba ofolo faibilifea ine biso sisa melaleluguba, nahe idele ainoda gilifea, aubasu gine gainodali sisa melaleba selesu. Ausenaga, gine gainodali aleba ami, noolohe Godene sulu sigiba dobelesalenaga, ilida sigiba domesine, gili sulu saeyomo dabalu male. Aubale. Gili ili sisa adesenaga, ilihe gine mana nafulu ilifea molofe amone bisigia, sigiba dubiyobafebile. <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />Gili Gode baaba sagilifia, E sisa ligia, mana galagololu kuliba daaba labi, ilihe gine mana bisigia, Godefea sigiba dubiyobafebile.<verse eid="1PE 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 2:9">1Dim 2.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Golo">momadasiamo</char>, idelehe guni alu nokeneba dofaloda, <char style="w">golo</char> helebe naiya dogaeyo kaaloda, helefagulo nenafolo kaaloda, kegele amogulumo bado saabianesu momada dilo. Ili auba auloso, gili auba momadasenaga, gili seale yogolelu melesi moloba ofolale. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Aubale. Gili gine libo amone usu momadasenaga, amo gili seale yogolelu nokene miliyobafe. Onaba adoda, gadaeaba adoda, mana amomo momada asigilelale ligia, Godene si saabia yogolelu saeyoda babealu labe. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Godene <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> idele amakele alolumo, ine <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame Godefea diba ofogofia yasifia</char> ligia, ine aino sisa koleba adaaba yaasia, ilida aubasu momada diaba ligia, onaba gadaeaba alolubiyo. <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:12">Stt 18.12</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Sela">Selahe</char> ene aino <char style="w">Abalahama</char> efeamo ne <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">saminilosia</char>, ene sulu dofasia, kuliba ano. Gilida isolu mana auba molosia, ulenohe gili hidigiba ofelesia sagilimesiale adesenaga, amo Sela ene elewelidali adefe.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efe 5.25</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aubasu, ainodali gili koleba, gine geamonodalidai ligiamo, asigida melale. Enebamo, idele ilimo, gine sama ligia, kiwida giligulu labalene, gilihe mana nafulu ilifea molomale. Mau enebamo, gili eweguba asigima. Godehe ilifeada kanuluba ofelesi, ili gilidai ua miliyolu dulu ligia, gilidai ua daalo diyobafe. Aulugulu, gilihe ili imini labe bisigia, ilifea mana nafulusu molomale. Kegele ulenohe gili <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selesimo</char> kaalosi, gili auba molomale.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hilia sunia ninihe noolofea mana nafulu moloyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Elosia, na eweguba selesu. Gili suniahe hilise ule mela. Aufia, gine geleba hilisefia, sagoba homale. Gine damenedali hameseba mela. Noolo anogofea kanulumale. Hamedufulu melale. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Wolu gafea molosimo, sabe wolu moloba obegemabiyo. Gafea saaba duduba selesimo, sabe saaba duduba obegemabiyo. Aubale koleba. Eweguba besiba molomale. Gafea woluda molofe ilifea sabe obegesia, ilifea <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba ofelesia</char>, ilifea mana nafulu obegeba molomale. Enebamo, gili welumo, auba no anogofea ediliba homesine welu. Gili auba ediliba ofalaba labi, gine gilifeada daalo mesia, ediliba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.10-12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Sng 34.12-16</ref></char></note>Enebamo, Godene Bugo eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 3:10" />
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">
    <char style="qt">Idele inolo, gili abehe gine miliyolu hamesia, helegeba asebaiyeba hamesenaga,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">
    <char style="qt">amo gili koleba, gine eanefea sulu woba saeyone waagi fogo memabiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:10">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, gine mofe gafohe masega sulu samesiale kaamale.</char><verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />
    <char style="qt">Aufia, gili koleba, wolufealo faiso mefia, mana nafulusu kuliba malale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:11">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, gili seloalo mana isasia, migagaba daaba melale.</char><verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />
    <char style="qt">Mau enebamo, Saminilone sihe, idele inolo isolu manada kuliba dedalefe ilifea nafuluba uluba miliyofia, si galifia labe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, Ene konenihe, sulu ili Edai selefemoda, dobolaba labe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 3:12">
    <char style="qt">Auluso, Ehe, woluda molofe ili amo Ene olegifea digi damesi gadefaeyobafe.</char><verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ninihe mana nafulu molofea ami naga dilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Gili mana nafulu koleba kuliba aasenaga, inolo ulenohe gili woba dafiyone, mau no male koleba. <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:12-13">Ais 8.12-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:10">Mad 5.10</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:20">1Fid 2.20</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:14">4.14</ref></char></note>Auluso, gilihe mana isolu molosi, naga disenagada, amo henelo gine libo aso wasigaabu. <char style="qt">Aulugulu, ilihe gilifea hidigiba ufiyo uleno molosimo, amohe gili hidigimabiyo. Aufia, gili sagilimabiyo.</char> <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Gine asigine libo usu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisomo</char>, ne <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> Saminilosia, Ehe gili yasifia uluba melesi waagi gadefamale. Aufia, idele inolo gilifea doba bisigia, “Gili Godefea asigi ule ofasia, <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofelagofia</char>, yasise ogo, mau amene?” Auba gilifea doba besenaga, amo gili obegeba saeyone, hilia sunia madeneba ufia melale. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:12">1Fid 2.12</ref></char></note>Aufia, ilifea sulu obegeba selesiamo, gine <char style="w">asigi nafulune si</char> galagololu ligia, ili baaba momolefia, onaba ligia, obegeba saamale. Gili mana auba mololabia daabasu ligia, noolohe mana nafulu gilihe Kelisofea kulifia ligia molofe amo, baaba gaidesia, gili saaba duduba selesi, gilihe ilimo yuaba ufiyobafe. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Ninihe nine wolu molofe amone naga disenaga, naga amo diloguba dife. Auluso, nini mana nafulu molosimo, Godehe nine mana nafulu molofe amofeafia nini naga dimesi hamesenaga, naga amo galagololu dobu.<verse eid="1PE 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Keliso nini gasiba dafelagoba diyone olafia degelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Gilihe Keliso mololu amoda asigimale. Ene E isolu ligiaso, isoluale alebaibu ine fogo disia, ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> heeba dafiyone, fogo uluse hamagi, naga difasia olalu. Ehe gili Gode labea ulubia milesi aulu. Helefealune huuda ado mana molola ami, ilihe E dufa olaluso, Asubaneda ado mana molola ami, Godehe E haiba bebea melesi moloba ufulu.<verse eid="1PE 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Asubane amofea alefasia, Ehe asubane dibolo dofalu alebaibia ami abia, ili ami alebaibumofea Godene sulu mana saaba melu. <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6-7">Stt 6–7</ref></char></note>Amakele kolebamo, ili amohe Godene sulu saidafulu. Auluso, Godehe ili amofea naga alebale sabeluale. Aubale. Noa aloiya fogo ami, Godehe ili asigi besimesisia, yasilabia esebalo ligiasu, hano sibi moloba samodosi elolu. Ausi, idele inolo bilale, aaiyoba amosu, hano sibimo sugalu. Aufia, hano bule galuba felasi, hano sibi amo elagolo fela daalu. Ausi, Godehe ili gasiba dafelagoba obegeba disi, ili nafulu asulu.<verse eid="1PE 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Hano galulu amomo, <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gelone</char> mana amone mimisiliba iminife. Enebamo, gili aga eweda hano gesi, Godehe gilimo gasiba dafelagofe. Hano gelomone maumo, domala nugumalu amone diba dafiyo amoale. Aubale. Nini hano gefea ami, nine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi nafulune si">asigi nafulune sida</char> ligia, nini Keliso Ene koleba loluba saaba dafelagofe. Yesu olaiya amifia degelu amofea alefasia, nini Ene koleba lolu. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Yesu degeba ifofasia, <char style="w">hebene</char> daafia, Godene sone lilibefealo labe. E ami labi, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">sulu dia ano</char> ilida, asubane kiwigagalu ilida, aufia kegele sunia wida solu kiwigagalu alebaibu ilida, ili amo sunia E sisa diba waalefia labe.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s">Nini koleba amakelelu mana afiyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 6:2">Lom 6.2</ref>, <ref loc="ROM 6:7">7</ref></char>
    </note>Keliso E Ene domalafea naga dulune, E naga difea ami hiliseluguba, gilida hilise amogubasu ofelesia, naga diyone madeneba melale.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yesu naga difea ami, Ehe waagimasia, selesia, “Nao-ooo, Ga ine wolu hamasia heesia galimaleba” solu.</char></note> Enebamo, uleno abehe ene domalafea naga disenaga, amohe ene meleba <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> moloyofealo kaaba dafulu.<note caller="†" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Uleno abehe Yesu kuliba abia, naga waagi disenaga, amohe wolu moloyone hamasia afolu. </char></note> <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Ausi, fogo gili domalada aso iwi ligiamo, helefealu idele inolone mesegelo mana saabia no kuliba maiyobafale. Aubale. Gili Godene hamesu kuliba maiyobafe. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:2-3">Efe 2.2-3</ref></char></note>Gili <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> moloyo hamefeguba mololabia dedalelumohe, hilia fogo weaselu. Amo ewe. Susugu manada, wolu mana moloyone libo degeloda, kagoalo manada, sigilo hulagaloda, hano kolelu wedinale noloda, aufia masega godefea gulugululo mana nugumalu amoda. Mana amogulu mololabia, hilia fogo saabia no weasemabiyo.<verse eid="1PE 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Gili aga, yau idele inolo ilidai ua mana kalemolu moloba ada ami, saabia no sugaeyale adesi, ilihe gili saabale baafia, enesi saabalebilesia, gilifea gaidaboba selefe. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:42">HD 10.42</ref></char></note>Auluso, Godehe bebea kakainabu ilida, daneba yaalu ilida, osolaeyomo madenefia labe. Aulune, ilida mana ine mololulumo Efea saaba meyone dobu. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Mau amo alefasia, daneba yaalu ilifeada awalu sulu nafulu walesi, ili dubulu. Saminimo, helefealu inolo osolaloguba, ili domalafealomo osolasi olalu. Auluso, ine asubanefealomo, Godefea alefasia, ilida miliyoluda bebea melesine, ilifeada awalu sulu nafulu walelu dobu.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulu kegele Godehe ninifea melumo, ninihe nafuluba moloyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.7 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 13:11-12">Lom 13.11-12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Kegele sunia eloyomo, aga hagoale adefe. Aulugulu, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu saeyone</char>, gili koleba, asigi nafuluba sawafia luba melale. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 1:22">1Fid 1.22</ref></char></note>Olaibo kegele kolebamo, gine gelebamo seba alebale, usu olaboba hamesemale. Maumo, hameselo mana amohe <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> wedinale mololumo heeba dafelefe. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:2">Hib 13.2</ref></char></note>Aufia, sigidubulu noolo gili labea sobele esenaga, amo gilihe ili amo koleba gogomobale nafuluba uluba melale. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:6-8">Lom 12.6-8</ref></char></note>Godehe gili suniafea kanulufia, dawalolo kegele nokene nokeneba gilifea mebu. Aulugulu, gilihe Ene <char style="w">kanululo</char> manada no anogofea sagaeyone dabalu moloba ligia, elebi elebiba dawalolo Gode gafea melu ogohe gine geleba sagoba homale. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Ga sulu no anogofea selefe ogoda, Gode Ene E sulu selefegubasu, kuliba abia saamale. Ga no anogofea sagoba ofelefe ogoda, kiwigagalu Godehe gafea melu amo alefasia, sagoba homale. Ausi, Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char> mololu amofea alefasia, idele inolohe Godene wi digiyobafe.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 4:11" />
  <para style="qc" vid="1PE 4:11">Kiwigagalumoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1PE 4:11">Elalelumoda,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1PE 4:11">Efea alefalu alefaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1PE 4:11">
    <char style="sls">
      <char style="w">Amen</char>.</char> Amo seale koleba.<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ninihe Keliso naga duluguba disimo, heneyo dobu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Ne yagusodali, doma. Dehe <char style="w" lemma="Golo">golo</char> sealelaba eloba babiyone dedeba bisigia sobologuba, dedeba babiyo halolugulu aga gili labea holobagafe. Aulugulu, gili amo bisigia, ogo eneba molofebisia, gili hidigisia keleba hilisemabiyo. Aubale. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:41">HD 5.41</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:2">Yem 1.2</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 1:6-7">1Fid 1.6-7</ref></char></note> Auluso, dedeba besabea ami naga dife ogo, Keliso E duluguba, gili Edai dafifia ligia, naga bule difegulu, gili bule henemale. Ausimo, Kelisone wabialelo wi bule <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elaleluda</char> ulufa holobagafea ami, gili nokene henesia, ibasia, aulo uliyobafe.<verse eid="1PE 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 2:20">1Fid 2.20</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Gilihe Kelisone wi sefia labi, amo alefasia, noolohe gilifea sulu woba selesenaga, gili henemale. Enebamo, mau auba molofe amo, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane</char> elalelumo gilifea labeba walefe. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Gili naga dife ogomo, wolu gine mololu amone sabe naga melosi. Inolo dufa olalumoneda, fa dulumoneda, inolo no anogone dabalu dabagalaba ufulu amoneda, amone koleba sabe gilifea naga melosi. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Auluso, ga “Kelisone adesuba” selesi, noolohe ga auba solu amone sabe naga gafea mesenaga, amone koleba yuabale ligia, Godene wi digiba saamale.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Godehe Ene mosomu idele inolo osolaeyo fogomo holobagafia labe. Ehe ninifeadale maugaba fadaasenaga, E elosiamo, Ene awalu sulu nafuluda saidafalilu ili amofea eneba moloyobafebi? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 11:31">Snd 11.31</ref></char></note>Godene bugohe eweguba selefe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 4:18" />
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 4:18">
    <char style="qt">Isolu idele inolo ili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diyonemo</char>, kolelu adesenaga,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 4:18">
    <char style="qt">amo idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu molosia</char>, Godefea faiso mesia waalefe ili amofea eneba moloyobafebi?</char><verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Aulugulu, idele inolo Godene hame amofea alefasia nagada dife gili amo, mana nafulu mololabiasu daaba ligia, gine miliyolu amo Godene sone saabia homale. Enebamo, Ene Ehe nini mololugulu, Ehe nini afiyobafale.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s">Seseda uluba adomone mana ewegulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Sesene guni inolo, gili doma. Na gilifea sulu saeyo hamefe. Na gilidai ua sesene guni inolo lolu. Aufia, <char style="w">Keliso</char> naga disi si abulumo, inolo uleno na. Aufia, Kelisone <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elalelumo</char> holobagasi, na amone heneba osolaba diyobasu. Elalelu amo holobagaeyomo hagoalefe. Na auba lolugulu, gilifea eweguba molomalesu. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 21:15-17">Yon 21.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:28">HD 20.28</ref></char></note>Godene idele inolo, dofene sibigulu, gine sone saabia sogolugaba waalelu dobu. Aulugulu, gili koleba, dofene sibi uluba adohe ine dofene sibi uluba adoguba, ili nafuluba uluba melale. Auba uluba miliyone, nohe gafea egedidiba molomaleluba hilisesia, haboba molomabiyo. Aubale. Gilihe dabalu amo, gene hame alefasia molobaiyeba hamefia, molomale. Godehe gili auba molomesi hamefe. Dabalu amo molosiamo, huliane kegele ge-ba diyosia, molomabiyo. Aubale. Gine seba alebale helegeba molomale. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 1:24">2Kld 1.24</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:17">Fil 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:7">Dai 2.7</ref></char></note>Aufia, gilihe sesene guni inolo ligiamo, Godehe dofene sibi gine sone saabia waalelu ogo, elasiaba yasiyone melabiyo. Aubale. Ilihe gili kuliba milesi, mimisililu nafulu moloba walemale. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Auba ausi, Dofene Sibi Uluba Ado Olaibomo ulufa holobagasimo, gilihe elebe amo diyobafe. Elebe amomo wolale, alefalu elalelu miliyobafe.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nini koleba nine meleba Godene sone saabia ufiyoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PRO 3:34">Snd 3.34</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 5:21">Efe 5.21</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:6">Yem 4.6</ref></char>
    </note>Faibe fisamilidai, ido budasiledai, aga gili doma. Gili gine guni inolo sisa ligia, ine sulu kuliba dedaleba melale. Aufia, gili sunia gine geleba adabia abia, mana no anogofea molosiamo, gine meleba helea melale. Enebamo, Godene Bugo eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 5:5" />
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 5:5">
    <char style="qt">Idele inolo ili ine meleba ana adesia bamabamafemo, Godehe ili amo anosi, kaaba dafolo labe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="1PE 5:5">
    <char style="qt">Auluso, idele inolo ine meleba helea adefemo, Godehe ilifea kanulufia, mana nafulu moloba ofolo.</char><verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mad 23.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:11">Lug 14.11</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:10">Yem 4.10</ref></char>
    </note>Aulune, gili gine hame ogo dufa dafogofia, helea adesia, Godene sone kiwigagaluhe ga uluba dibia malesi, ga E sisa melale. Ausi, Ene iminilu hilia adesimo, Ehe gili digiba lagoyobafe. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:25-30">Mad 6.25-30</ref></char></note>Kegele gili keleba hilisebu amo sunia, Efea meba lagomale. Enebamo, hilia sunia E gili asigibasu ado.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.8 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 22:14">Sng 22.14</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 5:6">1Des 5.6</ref></char>
    </note>Gili si kolafia melale. Madenefia yasifia melale. Enebamo, gine gisa, <char style="w">henane</char> ogohe, <char style="qt"><char style="w" lemma="Laeono">laeonogulu</char> hulolabia siba labe</char>. Hilia sunia ehe idele inolo dufa naiyosia, fuduba isaba labe. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:27">Efe 4.27</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:11-13">6.11-13</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:7">Yem 4.7</ref></char></note>Auluso, gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulufea</char> kiwigaafia ligia, e dibia saidamale. Gili asigibu, gine sigidubulu damene helefealu sunia alebaibu ilida, naga gili dife aubasu dife.<verse eid="1PE 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Gode E <char style="w">kanululo</char> suniane mau labe. Ehe gili welumo, Yesu Kelisofea alefasia, gili Ene <char style="w">elalelu</char> usu alefalu melesi welu. Aga iwi gili naga diaba labemo, fogo abobo miliyobafe. Aufia, fogo abobo amone faisamo, Ehe gili kiwigaaba ofelesia, gili haiba nafulu melesi seba ufiyobafe. Aufia, gili waminimesiale kalugaamesi moloba ufiyobafe.<verse eid="1PE 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="qc">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Kiwigagalumo,</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1PE 5:11">Efea alefalu alefaeyobafe.</para>
  <para style="qc" vid="1PE 5:11">
    <char style="sls">
      <char style="w">Amen</char>.</char> Amo seale koleba.<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Afelesia sulu haisi noolo selesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:22">HD 15.22</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:37-40">37-40</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:2">12.2</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13.13</ref></char>
    </note>Sowi abobodeno ewe gilifea seleba mesumo, Saelese ene sonehe na sagoba ofelesia, seleba ofeleso. E-mo, ne nelewo nafulu labeba bosolu. E seale sulu selesia, dabalu fedoba seba ado. Sowi ewehe na gilifea selesumo, Godehe kanulusia Ene mana sunia mololo amone selesu. Nene na-mo, Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> kolebamo dawalofia, amone gilifea ulufaba selesu. Na-mo gili Efea kiwigaafia yoba melesi selesu.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2TI 4:11">2Dim 4.11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:2">HD 12.2</ref></char>
    </note>Idele inolo <char style="w">Babilono</char> sidi iwi alebaibumo, gilidai ua molobebelelu alebaibu, ili ewehe gilifea hawiyoba seleso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fidahe iwimo </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Babilono sidi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba selefemo, Lome sidi amone dedeba selefe. Mau enebamo, Fida aloiya fogo ami, Lome idele inolo ilihe sigidubulu idele inolofea wolu mololu. Babilono idele inolo samini mololuguba, ili amogubasu mololu.</char></note> Aufia, ne faibe <char style="w" lemma="Maga">Maga</char>, eda gilifea hawiyoso. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Gili gine geleba wakalisiamo, hameseba ligia, mimiba wakalimale.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1PE 5:14" />
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 5:14">Gili Kelisodai kulifia labimo, gine libo <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> miliyobafe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="EndOfBookOnobasulu_Epistles.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="5.14" /><verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>